 "title": "Five-Seven Squeeze: Compress Thoughts into Tanka",
 "tagline": "Squeeze a thought into the sound pattern of Japanese verse, or play rounds to fit words into 5-7-5 and 5-7-5-7-7.",
 "lead": "Type a thought in English or Japanese, and the page squeezes it into the sound pattern of classical Japanese verse. Or play a round: write a verse for a set thought, hit the sound counts, and keep the key words.",
